 "applies_to": "Neptronic SKRO reverse osmosis water treatment units with the Modbus communication module, guide SKRO-Modbus Guide-250913 (V1.0).",
 "summary": "The SKRO is Neptronic's reverse osmosis unit that feeds purified water to its humidifiers. The Modbus RTU module exposes holding registers for inlet, permeate and concentrate pressures, the TDS reading, flow settings, motor and valve states, level floats, warnings, the operating state and an enumerated system alarm, plus a power on/off and request register.",
 "transport": [
  "RTU"
 ],
